Usecase UC1 "Turn light on" (
Description: "The user sends an objectChanged event, and the light turns on, then off"
Scope: "Room"
Actors: "Room", "light"
Preconditions:
    Entity "light" is in state "light_off"
    Property "is_on" for entity "light" equal to "false"
Flow "Regular":
    1) User performs action "movement detected" with property "duration" equal to "4.0"
    2) Entity "light" transitions to state "movement_detected"
    3) Entity "light" transitions to state "light_on"
    4) Property "is_on" for entity "light" equal to "true"
    5) Entity "light" transitions to state "light_off"
Flow "Timer":
    1) User performs action "movement detected" with property "duration" equal to "4.0"
    2) Entity "light" transitions to state "movement_detected"
    3) Entity "light" transitions to state "light_on"
    4) Property "timer" for entity "light" is greater than "0"
    5) Property "is_on" for entity "light" equal to "true"
    6) Property "timer" for entity "light" is less than "5"
    7) Entity "light" transitions to state "light_off"
Postconditions:
    Entity "light" is in state "light_off"
    Property "is_on" for entity "light" equal to "false"
)